    "y": 50
   },
   "reshape": {
    "x": 25,
    "y": 50
   }
  },
  "hidden_moral_score": false,
  "canonical_facts": [
   "The mission consumes the Mission 01 founding Well decision and selects one of three authored memory hollows from it.",
   "The Harvest founding decision selects the Cinder Hollow geometry, anchored at tile 14,28 with its confluence at tile 14,50.",
   "The Preserve founding decision selects the Held Hollow geometry, anchored at tile 32,28 with its confluence at tile 32,50.",
   "The Reshape founding decision selects the Folded Hollow geometry, anchored at tile 48,20 with its confluence at tile 25,50.",
   "The Waystone must be rooted at the anchor before the Listening Spine, and the Spine raised before the witnesses can be positioned.",
   "Both memory witnesses must stand at their sites before the confluence phase, and completion requires Oruun himself at the confluence.",
   "Losing the local core, Oruun, the Waystone, or either witness, or reaching a terminal engagement outcome, fails the attempt irreversibly."
  ],
  "prohibited_inferences": [
   "The correspondence between the erased census and the communal omissions is bounded; no cause is established.",
   "No hidden author of either erasure is identified.",
   "No Choir identity is established by this mission.",
   "The Assembly confrontation the correspondence gestures toward is not completed here.",
   "The witnesses' accounts are not established as true, only as positioned and heard.",
   "No claim about what the silence contains is established, only its shape."
  ]
 },
